    {
      "flavor_text": "MAKUHITA is tenacious - it will keep\ngetting up and attacking its foe\nhowever many times it is knocked down.\fEvery time it gets back up, this\nPOKéMON stores more energy in its body\nfor evolving.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
